# Repository Structure

**Project**: Customer Churn Prediction ML (M.Sc. DSAI — Advanced Apex Project)

> **Single Source of Truth**: For the complete and detailed repository structure, refer to [docs/01-repository-structure.md](../../docs/01-repository-structure.md).

## Quick Summary

- **`data/raw/`**: Immutable source datasets. Never modify.
- **`data/processed/`**: Cleaned and transformed datasets for modelling.
- **`notebooks/`**: Numbered workflow notebooks (`01_` through `05_`).
- **`src/data_preprocessing/`**: Reusable preprocessing logic.
- **`src/feature_engineering/`**: Feature creation and transformation.
- **`src/modeling/`**: Model training and inference.
- **`src/evaluation/`**: Metrics, validation, and model comparison.
- **`reports/figures/`**: Exported charts and report-ready visuals.
- **`docs/`**: Project documentation.

When writing or updating public-facing structure (e.g., `README.md` or `docs/01-repository-structure.md`), do not list internal-only paths or mention data file contents.
